Alembic migrations for visual-ai.

Common commands (run from the project root, with the Postgres service up):

    alembic upgrade head                      # apply all migrations
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"  # generate a new migration from model changes
    alembic downgrade -1                       # roll back one migration

The DB URL and target metadata are wired from app settings in env.py, so no
sqlalchemy.url needs to be set in alembic.ini.
